G0012.def:
**ἄ-βυσσος**, -ον (Ion. βυσσός = βυθός),
1. in cl., **boundless, bottomless** (e.g. ἄ. πέλαγος, ἄ. πλοῦτος Æsch.).
2. [In LXX (for תְּהוֹם, [[Gen.1.2|Gen.1:2]], al.; exc. [[Isa.44.27|Isa.44:27]], [[Job.41.22|Job.41:22]] for צוּלָה, מְצוּלָה, [[Job.36.16|Job.36:16]] for רַחַב) and] NT, as subst. (MM, _VGT_, see word), ἡ ἄ. (sc. χώρα), **the abyss**;
(a) of the sea ([[Gen.1.2|Gen.1:2]]);
(b) **of the underworld, as the abode of the dead**: [[Rom.10.7|Rom.10:7]] (a paraphrase of [[Deu.30.13|Deu.30:13]] LXX); as the abode of demons, [[Luk.8.31|Luk.8:31]], [[Rev.9.1, 2, 11; 11.7; 17.8; 20.1, 3|Rev.9:1, 2, 11, 11:7, 17:8, 20:1, 3]] (Cremer, 2).
† (AS)

G0048.def:
**ἁγνίζω** (&gt; ἁγνός),
[in LXX always ceremonially, chiefly for קָדַשׁ ;]
**to purify**, **cleanse from defilement**;
(a) **ceremonially**: [[Jhn.11.55|Jhn.11:55]], [[Act.21.24, 26; 24.18|Act.21:24, 26 24:18]];
(b) **morally**: [[Jas.4.8|Jas.4:8]], [[1Pe.1.22|1Pe.1:22]], [[1Jn.3.3|1Jn.3:3]]
† _SYN._: καθαρίζω, which see (and see: ἁγνός). (AS)

G0003.def:
**Ἀβαδδών** (Heb. אֲבַדּוֹן, **destruction**; LXX, ἀπώλεια, only in Wisdom Lit., of the place of the ruined dead: [[Job.26.6; 28.22; 31.12|Job.26:6, 28:22, 31:12]], [[Psa.88.12|Psa.88:12]], [[Pro.15.11|Pro.15:11]]*), indecl.;
in NT, **Abaddon**, the angel of the Abyss: [[Rev.9.11|Rev.9:11]]†
(AS)
